{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §2.2.3, [TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.6"
  description: """
    `pick.t` is typed `kind<record>`, the names of the record types, and `shape` resolves in the importing
    schema to a type built with `record`. The kind's members are computed over the closure of the schema
    holding the name.
    """
  valid: {
    binds: [os shape ps]
  }
